      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَانٍ</span></b>  <i>Watering:</i> [and <i>drawing water:</i>] applied
[as an epithet] to a man and to a camel: pl.
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سُنَاةٌ</span>; which is applied by Lebeed to men [as
meaning] <i>drawing water by means of</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَوَانٍ</span> [pl.
of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَانِيَةٌ</span>, q. v.]. (TA.)

